sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as You, with your passkey
  participant A as ZyroPay API
  participant T as Turnkey, your sub-org
  participant C as AI client
  U->>A: switch an agent to Autonomous
  A-->>U: public half of a new P-256 key (private half stored encrypted)
  U->>T: passkey creates a non-root user holding that key
  U->>T: passkey creates the policy envelope: chains, recipients, per-payment caps
  U->>A: save the policy with the stamped envelope request
  A->>T: forward it unchanged, record the policy ids
  C->>A: later: send to an allowlisted recipient
  A->>A: USD per-payment, daily, monthly limits on spent plus reserved, then reserve
  A->>T: sign with the delegated key
  Note over T: Turnkey signs only inside the envelope. Cardano and swaps never reach this path.
  A->>A: check signed bytes against reviewed bytes, broadcast, settle on confirmation
